ume (~1,280 rush yds, 15 total TD)."},"4890973":{"tone":"good","short":"300+ touches","note":"Kubiak wide-zone scheme fits him; staff targeting 300-335 touches plus a bigger passing role. Rookie-year letdown is your discount."},"4362628":{"tone":"good","short":"cleared","note":"Aug 25 knee scare was a minor hyperextension; said he could play the next day. Held out purely as precaution. Draft normally."},"4689114":{"tone":"good","short":"top plateau QB","note":"8 top-10 weeks as a rookie in ~12 games. New staff, healthy Nabers, real rushing upside. Best of the QB plateau. Caveat: concussion history from how he runs."},"4426338":{"tone":"good","short":"QB11 ppg","note":"Finished QB11 in points per game even in a down year, age 26. Worth a top-4-round pick in superflex."},"4242335":{"tone":"warn","short":"QB-dependent","note":"Was RB2 per game with Daniel Jones healthy, RB22 without him. Jones returns from an Achilles tear. Huge range of outcomes."},"4429160":{"tone":"warn","short":"new OC","note":"New OC Bobby Slowik plans to run more, but 43% of his PPR value came through the air and Malik Willis rarely checks down. Receiving floor is the risk."},"4426515":{"tone":"good","short":"practicing","note":"Groin scare is behind him - returned to full practice Aug 30 and trending to play Week 1."},"4258173":{"tone":"good","short":"target funnel","note":"Jayden Higgins (torn ACL, out for the year) and Tank Dell (IR, ACL+MCL) are both gone - Houston's WR target tree collapses onto him. Late-August news the market may not have priced yet."},"4431459":{"tone":"warn","short":"groin-limited","note":"Groin injury has kept him limited through late camp. Team calls it minor, but reps have been sparse - small discount vs a clean TE3."},"4572680":{"tone":"warn","short":"ACL Week 1?","note":"Coming off last season's torn ACL; as of late Aug the team says only 'a shot' to be ready for Week 1."},"4426385":{"tone":"warn","short":"PUP 4+ games","note":"Moved to reserve/PUP Aug 29 (ACL recovery) - out at least the first 4 games. IR-stash only."}}}